WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:02.434
-A lot of people
are still talking about

00:00:02.434 --> 00:00:03.601
their New Year's resolutions.

00:00:03.601 --> 00:00:05.334
My resolution this year
is to travel more.

00:00:05.334 --> 00:00:07.167
Quest, what's yours?

00:00:07.167 --> 00:00:09.000
-Hey, I'm gonna go to the gym
more, you know?

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.501
My calves are gonna be
as buff as phonebooks.

00:00:11.501 --> 00:00:13.367
-Nice. What about you, Higgins?

00:00:13.367 --> 00:00:15.934
-[ Coughs ]
-I'm cutting back on smoking.

00:00:15.934 --> 00:00:17.801
Now I'm on -- [ Coughs ]
just like three packs a day.

00:00:17.801 --> 00:00:19.434
That's it.
-That's good. That's great.

00:00:19.434 --> 00:00:22.133
James, what about your
New Year's resolution?

00:00:22.133 --> 00:00:23.868
-[ Speaking Na'vi ]

00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:55.133
[ Laughter ]

00:01:05.467 --> 00:01:07.067
-What?

00:01:07.067 --> 00:01:09.334
-[ Speaking Na'vi ]

00:01:19.634 --> 00:01:21.667
[ Laughs ]

00:01:21.667 --> 00:01:23.334
[ Laughter ]

00:01:35.300 --> 00:01:37.734
[ Laughter ]

00:01:51.501 --> 00:01:53.601
[ Laughter ]

00:02:03.801 --> 00:02:05.300
Come on.

00:02:05.300 --> 00:02:07.133
[ Rimshot ]

00:02:11.767 --> 00:02:13.601
[ Laughter ]

00:02:18.167 --> 00:02:20.767
[ Laughter ]

00:02:31.334 --> 00:02:32.934
What?

00:02:32.934 --> 00:02:34.300
[ Laughter ]

00:02:34.300 --> 00:02:36.267
-Oh, my God.

00:02:36.267 --> 00:02:39.300
Okay.

00:02:39.300 --> 00:02:40.634
Alright.

00:02:45.167 --> 00:02:47.467
[ Laughter ]

00:02:50.267 --> 00:02:51.767
-Wow.

00:02:51.767 --> 00:02:55.901
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:55.901 --> 00:02:57.400
-Wow!

00:02:57.400 --> 00:02:59.234
He already learned Na'vi.
That's great.

00:02:59.234 --> 00:03:01.801
-He speaks fluent Na'vi, yeah.

00:03:01.801 --> 00:03:03.634
-He's a whiz with an air fryer.

